## 10. Quick reference card

```
What a client pays      = dns_ms + ms
What the VA took        = ms − 2 × tcp_ms
What the network took   = 2 × tcp_ms
What DNS took           = dns_ms

Healthy (from next door):  dns ~100  tcp ~6-11   ms ~100   VA ~75
Healthy (cross-site):      dns ~100  tcp ~35     ms ~180   VA ~110
Oct 20 incident node:      dns   -   tcp  35     ms ~700   VA ~630

Alert when a node's VA time > 3× its own 24 h median, two runs in a row.
Compare nodes by VA time, never by raw ms.
Compare probes only against themselves.
```
